{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26143","headline":"赋得玉声如乐 · 潘存实","name":"赋得玉声如乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"表质自坚贞，因人一扣鸣。\n静将金并响，妙与乐同声。\n杳杳疑风送，泠泠似曲成。\n韵含湘瑟切，音带舜弦清。\n不独藏虹气，犹能畅物情。\n后夔如爲听，从此振琮琤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"潘存实","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}